  "broader": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/rea/301",
  "definition": "Filing Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-07-21",
  "historyNote": "#2130, eff 8-30-82; ss by #2847, eff 9-19-84; ss by #4304, eff 8-21-87; ss by #4559, eff 12-28-88; amd by #4713, eff 11-28-89; ss by #5569, eff 2-11-93, EXPIRED: 2-11-99 New. #7162, INTERIM, eff 12-18-99, EXPIRED: 4-16-00 New. #7264, eff 5-6-00; ss by #7520, eff 6-28-01; ss by #8832, eff 5-1-07; amd by #9301, eff 10-22-08; amd by #10147, eff 8-1-12; paragraphs (a)-(f), (h), (i), (l), (n), (q), & (r) EXPIRED: 5-1-15; amd by #11030, INTERIM RULE, eff 1-28-16, paras (a)-(f), (h), (i), (l), (n), (q), & (r) EXPIRED: 7-26-16, paras (g), (k), (o) (p), & (s) EXPIRED: 10-22-16; ss by #12213, eff 6-18-17; ss by #12977-B, eff 1-23-20; ss by #13240, eff 7-21-21",
